direction: right

gru: GRU (Gated Recurrent Unit) 结构详解 {
  shape: package
  style: {
    stroke: "#16a34a"
    stroke-width: 2
    fill: transparent
  }

  h_prev: "h_{t-1}\n(上一时刻隐藏状态)" { shape: cylinder; style.stroke: "#2563eb" }
  x: "x_t\n(当前输入)" { shape: parallelogram; style.stroke: "#dc2626" }

  z: "z_t\n(更新门)\n保留多少旧状态\n写入多少新状态" { shape: rectangle; style.stroke: "#ca8a04" }
  r: "r_t\n(重置门)\n生成候选状态时\n参考多少过去信息" { shape: rectangle; style.stroke: "#ca8a04" }
  
  mul_r: "\times" { shape: circle }
  h_tilde: "\tilde{h}_t\n(候选隐藏状态)\n根据 x_t 和 r_t \odot h_{t-1}\n生成候选状态" { shape: rectangle; style.stroke: "#9333ea" }
  
  one_minus_z: "1 - z_t" { shape: rectangle; style.stroke: "#2563eb" }
  
  mul_old: "\times" { shape: circle }
  mul_new: "\times" { shape: circle }
  add_h: "+" { shape: circle }

  h_curr: "h_t\n(新的隐藏状态/当前输出)" { shape: cylinder; style.stroke: "#2563eb" }

  h_prev -> z
  x -> z
  h_prev -> r
  x -> r
  
  r -> mul_r
  h_prev -> mul_r
  
  mul_r -> h_tilde
  x -> h_tilde
  
  z -> one_minus_z
  one_minus_z -> mul_old
  h_prev -> mul_old
  
  z -> mul_new
  h_tilde -> mul_new
  
  mul_old -> add_h: "(1-z_t) \odot h_{t-1}"
  mul_new -> add_h: "z_t \odot \tilde{h}_t"
  
  add_h -> h_curr
}

note: |md
  **核心直觉**：
  GRU 可以理解为：
  用 **update gate (z_t)** 决定“旧状态保留多少、新状态写入多少”；
  用 **reset gate (r_t)** 决定“生成新状态时，要看多少历史”。
| {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: transparent
  style.stroke: "#ca8a04"
}

gru -> note { style.stroke: transparent }
